<title>UK: Tesco prices 250 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Tesco prices 250 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced,</p>
<p>lead manager UBS said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TESCO PLC </p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     7.50	MATURITY    30.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.957    PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.35	REOFFER    98.957    SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> IBCA	 AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  0.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.25 PCT 2007 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
